%% D14 - Password display states. Generate, reveal, copy, and clear actions change the visible password state.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> Hidden: Generate with hide enabled
    Empty --> Revealed: Generate with hide disabled
    Hidden --> Revealed: Reveal
    Revealed --> Hidden: Hide
    Hidden --> Copied: Copy
    Revealed --> Copied: Copy
    Copied --> Hidden: Return to masked view
    Copied --> Revealed: Return to visible view
    Hidden --> Cleared: Clear
    Revealed --> Cleared: Clear
    Copied --> Cleared: Clear
    Cleared --> Empty
